  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bbq bread turns a slow afternoon by the grill into pure comfort, its golden crust hiding pockets of smoky paprika and melted cheddar. Picture warm loaves filled with air bubbles that carry the scent of roasted garlic, caramelized onions, and a touch of honey for gentle sweetness. Instead of alcohol, zesty apple cider vinegar and a splash of sparkling water give each slice a tender crumb and bright tang. Brush your bbq bread with rich barbecue sauce, grill until you see those tempting char marks, then tear into warm pieces oozing cheesy goodness with every bite.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-bbq-bread\">Why You’ll Love This bbq bread</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-bbq-bread\">How to Make BBQ Bread</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-bbq-bread\">Pro Tips for Making bbq bread</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-bbq-bread\">How to Serve this bbq bread</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-bbq-bread\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This bbq bread</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It’s a delightful twist on traditional bread with a smoky flavor.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for summer barbecues or cozy indoor meals.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to customize with your favorite herbs and spices.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for dipping in sauces or enjoying on its own.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Brings friends and family together around the grill!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7807\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7807\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-re